  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Det nuvarande avtal f&#xf6;r forskningssamabete med Makerer University g&#xe5;r ut 2015-06-30 och det p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r f&#xf6;rberedelser f&#xf6;r en m&#xf6;jlig forts&#xe4;ttning av detta samarbet. Denna internkontroll granskning &#xe4;r en del av bed&#xf6;mningen inf&#xf6;r en eventuell forts&#xe4;ttning av detta samarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The current bilateral research cooperation with Makerere University comes to an end on 30 June 2015, and preparations for possible continued support as from 1 July 2015 is underway. Before ntering into a new agreement, Sida has to carry out a risk analysis, a part of which is an assessment of internal management and control of the potential partner. This is an assessment of internal management and control at Makerere University, as an input in preparations for possible continued support to bilateral research cooperation with Makerere University as from 2015 and onwards</narrative>
  </description>
